WEBVTT

c9ee82e9-a522-48a6-989d-33b07aca7abd-0
00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:05.800
Welcome to the Hand Hygiene and
Garbing Lab demonstration video.

baae17bf-dfcf-4775-9d99-18b8ddcf9684-0
00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:09.600
The compounder has removed outer
garments, jewelry.

fedaface-e4cd-4605-b997-ff4f55f10bff-0
00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:12.040
If you have long hair, pull it
back.

be5667fe-1b53-4725-9bfc-93bfe4329b5c-0
00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:16.007
You want to be makeup free free
of nail Polish and artificial

be5667fe-1b53-4725-9bfc-93bfe4329b5c-1
00:00:16.007 --> 00:00:16.360
nails.

5df1b5d9-fe0b-44fa-b2b5-14b104e02363-0
00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:20.210
The best practice is to hand
sanitize prior to each step of

5df1b5d9-fe0b-44fa-b2b5-14b104e02363-1
00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:21.320
the garbing process.

089faa81-00d1-4e1c-a20b-744b53a149a7-0
00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:25.921
As you step over the line of
demarcation from The Dirty side

089faa81-00d1-4e1c-a20b-744b53a149a7-1
00:00:25.921 --> 00:00:29.474
to the clean side of the
anteroom, you'll Don that first

089faa81-00d1-4e1c-a20b-744b53a149a7-2
00:00:29.474 --> 00:00:30.160
shoe cover.

581addda-2fa5-4be6-87de-5c6467448200-0
00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:36.298
You want to slip the larger end
of the shoe cover into the toe

581addda-2fa5-4be6-87de-5c6467448200-1
00:00:36.298 --> 00:00:41.192
of the shoe and then pull the
bottom over the shoe onto the

581addda-2fa5-4be6-87de-5c6467448200-2
00:00:41.192 --> 00:00:41.600
heel.

ecdf3645-fe67-424b-b0bf-aab9beb95f12-0
00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:47.853
Notice that the compounder is
hand sanitizing between each

ecdf3645-fe67-424b-b0bf-aab9beb95f12-1
00:00:47.853 --> 00:00:50.840
time that they Don the shoe
covers.

4abe9c3a-ca39-4595-a6ad-bccb33aaa31a-0
00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:57.960
Now that we're on the clean side
of the anteroom, hand sanitize.

e09c68f6-d65c-4007-8e24-69367944562b-0
00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:03.360
Now place the bouffant style cap
or head cover over your head so

e09c68f6-d65c-4007-8e24-69367944562b-1
00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:05.840
that most of the hair is in the
back.

25c833f2-d9df-4a08-8ae6-c4ec9eada8f4-0
00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:09.440
Cover the skin on your forehead.

eeae2bd2-7ced-4ce6-8dfa-314494e69df5-0
00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:12.080
Tuck in any loose hairs.

f3f03c5a-5436-4cdf-947b-5188c93a3766-0
00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:22.760
Hand sanitize with a 70% IPA rub
and then Don the face mask.

a91e4e4f-0904-4b3c-a0fe-698ebec84aa2-0
00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:27.555
Put the top of the mask to the
bridge of the nose and gently

a91e4e4f-0904-4b3c-a0fe-698ebec84aa2-1
00:01:27.555 --> 00:01:30.840
pinch the aluminum strip woven
into the mask.

a4c36a44-0ff0-4310-ba17-5f1983881ff0-0
00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:34.920
Position the loops around your
ears.

3dfb4608-e63a-4211-8f18-e9fd3ceec068-0
00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:39.190
Make sure you tuck in any of
your hair and now we will

3dfb4608-e63a-4211-8f18-e9fd3ceec068-1
00:01:39.190 --> 00:01:41.040
prepare for hand washing.

d6d6ed13-4500-4194-bfc7-0a6da2379530-0
00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:50.792
Welcome to the hand washing
portion of hand hygiene and

d6d6ed13-4500-4194-bfc7-0a6da2379530-1
00:01:50.792 --> 00:01:51.960
garbing procedure.

a7542c70-346a-4f57-b930-98c5a614e9dc-0
00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:56.520
Take the time to review the step
by step actions you must follow.

09b945bb-1c9f-480e-9f8c-8d173410bd85-0
00:01:56.520 --> 00:01:58.560
During this hand washing
procedure.

6a49f1e8-9fbe-4e27-bce8-0c907ab59e90-0
00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:04.280
We will focus on the hand
washing part of the procedure.

b03c1a37-b184-4d1d-aaa5-4f7a4df2bca6-0
00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:10.157
So far we have donned our shoe
covers, our bouffant style cap

b03c1a37-b184-4d1d-aaa5-4f7a4df2bca6-1
00:02:10.157 --> 00:02:15.754
or head cover, our face mask,
and now we will prepare to hand

b03c1a37-b184-4d1d-aaa5-4f7a4df2bca6-2
00:02:15.754 --> 00:02:20.719
wash before we open the sterile
surgical scrub sponge.

cb6186a1-e732-438d-a022-b97bbeef3854-0
00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:28.708
The compounder will squeeze the
packet several times to activate

cb6186a1-e732-438d-a022-b97bbeef3854-1
00:02:28.708 --> 00:02:29.800
the soap sets.

980687c5-5903-4315-b1a9-6574ec36f6a3-0
00:02:30.320 --> 00:02:34.145
The compounder will activate the
automatic sensor to begin the

980687c5-5903-4315-b1a9-6574ec36f6a3-1
00:02:34.145 --> 00:02:37.000
water flow throughout the entire
hand washing.

6b2e25fc-b0bf-4093-8f45-481ee9539cba-0
00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:44.204
Open the package of the surgical
scrub and you'll place the nail

6b2e25fc-b0bf-4093-8f45-481ee9539cba-1
00:02:44.204 --> 00:02:50.160
cleaner so that you can clean
under each of your fingernails.

0f3274aa-471f-4b94-abd5-683c6982166c-0
00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:55.032
Be sure to position the nail
pick so that you don't

0f3274aa-471f-4b94-abd5-683c6982166c-1
00:02:55.032 --> 00:02:59.798
contaminate the sponge with
debris from your fingernails,

0f3274aa-471f-4b94-abd5-683c6982166c-2
00:02:59.798 --> 00:03:01.360
and we'll continue.

c0510ae0-14ab-4f17-9788-5595c3a028fe-0
00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:06.510
On the other hand, when
finished, you can discard the

c0510ae0-14ab-4f17-9788-5595c3a028fe-1
00:03:06.510 --> 00:03:10.040
nail cleaner in the waste
container.

a4b4ab4b-3c87-4dfe-b1f2-b6e1b5c870b0-0
00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:14.680
Do not use the brush side of the
sponge.

d647872f-4318-49d2-98bc-75d0114a16f2-0
00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:23.227
Per USP 797, we'll use the
sponge side to clean all four

d647872f-4318-49d2-98bc-75d0114a16f2-1
00:03:23.227 --> 00:03:32.099
surfaces of each finger, the
top, the side, the bottom, and

d647872f-4318-49d2-98bc-75d0114a16f2-2
00:03:32.099 --> 00:03:33.430
the side.

08df9e4a-bec8-46c3-b238-613c1b6a2c6a-0
00:03:34.390 --> 00:03:41.391
And then we'll clean the webbing
and then the top, the bottom the

08df9e4a-bec8-46c3-b238-613c1b6a2c6a-1
00:03:41.391 --> 00:03:48.074
side the webbing, the top side
the bottom the webbing, the top

08df9e4a-bec8-46c3-b238-613c1b6a2c6a-2
00:03:48.074 --> 00:03:54.758
the side the bottom the side and
the webbing, the top the side

08df9e4a-bec8-46c3-b238-613c1b6a2c6a-3
00:03:54.758 --> 00:03:56.880
the bottom the side.

9cecf14e-08b9-4b36-bf5f-6e99a1cdce4c-0
00:03:57.400 --> 00:04:02.419
And then we'll switch hands,
clean the top of the thumb, the

9cecf14e-08b9-4b36-bf5f-6e99a1cdce4c-1
00:04:02.419 --> 00:04:06.040
side, the bottom the side, Get
the webbing.

ba7cd3be-1793-438d-8e41-0b0ee5af4bb3-0
00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:12.660
Clean the top of your
forefinger, the side, the bottom

ba7cd3be-1793-438d-8e41-0b0ee5af4bb3-1
00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:18.937
the side, the webbing the top
the side, the bottom the side,

ba7cd3be-1793-438d-8e41-0b0ee5af4bb3-2
00:04:18.937 --> 00:04:24.700
the webbing, the top the side,
the bottom the side, the

ba7cd3be-1793-438d-8e41-0b0ee5af4bb3-3
00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:29.640
webbing, the top the side, the
bottom the side.

75eb75a3-8930-40fe-9f92-cca810d0ea36-0
00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:34.967
And now we'll do the palm of
each hand cleaning from the

75eb75a3-8930-40fe-9f92-cca810d0ea36-1
00:04:34.967 --> 00:04:36.680
fingers to the wrist.

2af38305-e71f-4bd0-ae9c-77169a5a171f-0
00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:41.340
We'll clean the palm of the
other hand from the fingers to

2af38305-e71f-4bd0-ae9c-77169a5a171f-1
00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:41.880
the wrist.

5db21eb8-2649-4d45-a799-b8ad5b18517e-0
00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:47.079
Next, you will clean the back of
the hand, focusing on the

5db21eb8-2649-4d45-a799-b8ad5b18517e-1
00:04:47.079 --> 00:04:49.520
knuckles from the fingers to the
wrist.

1786e6b1-7535-474b-9849-69e64195e59c-0
00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:54.000
We'll clean the back of the
other hand.

8e2ba8e9-f74c-4a28-a2c4-e5b8928a36d3-0
00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:57.436
You can get a small amount of
water if you don't have enough

8e2ba8e9-f74c-4a28-a2c4-e5b8928a36d3-1
00:04:57.436 --> 00:04:58.000
soap suds.

21cf6699-239b-417d-a4c2-3717591be305-0
00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:04.577
Finally, we'll clean from the
wrist to the elbow of our

21cf6699-239b-417d-a4c2-3717591be305-1
00:05:04.577 --> 00:05:09.315
forearm, going in circular
motion around the arm until you

21cf6699-239b-417d-a4c2-3717591be305-2
00:05:09.315 --> 00:05:10.600
reach the elbow.

8c6a2c9f-dbb5-458c-9e7e-55502c529cfb-0
00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:18.738
You can put your sponge
momentarily in the water to get

8c6a2c9f-dbb5-458c-9e7e-55502c529cfb-1
00:05:18.738 --> 00:05:19.600
more soap sets.

287e550b-d3b3-44d9-9052-751f7872aa36-0
00:05:20.120 --> 00:05:25.090
We'll start at the wrist of our
other arm, and we'll clean that

287e550b-d3b3-44d9-9052-751f7872aa36-1
00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:29.828
forearm in circular motion,
going all the way around the arm

287e550b-d3b3-44d9-9052-751f7872aa36-2
00:05:29.828 --> 00:05:34.643
until we get to the elbow, and
then you can throw that sponge

287e550b-d3b3-44d9-9052-751f7872aa36-3
00:05:34.643 --> 00:05:37.439
away with your fingers pointing
up.

33e3542e-b0fa-4738-a9dc-f824f391e7cb-0
00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:40.000
We're going to take a pass
through the water.

991e0200-6ef7-43d2-98c3-4c6fb4d51dd2-0
00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:43.960
Take a moment to rinse.

8403a57d-97d4-46fa-bb3f-7c913a245793-0
00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:46.600
Notice that those fingers are
pointing up.

377c78fb-8ff7-4c29-aa73-8a8dd54505a0-0
00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:52.090
The compounder is looking at all
the sides of the arm all the way

377c78fb-8ff7-4c29-aa73-8a8dd54505a0-1
00:05:52.090 --> 00:05:52.880
to the elbow.

141da8e2-1030-4731-bb54-44cfd4465671-0
00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:58.189
If you see any soap sets, go
ahead and do another pass

141da8e2-1030-4731-bb54-44cfd4465671-1
00:05:58.189 --> 00:06:04.560
through the water and then we'll
rinse the other hand fingers up.

c5bc1c91-c7dd-4ec7-95a0-ff512ae55f72-0
00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:10.265
Take a moment and clean off the
fingers and gradually move to

c5bc1c91-c7dd-4ec7-95a0-ff512ae55f72-1
00:06:10.265 --> 00:06:11.200
your elbow.

6372ece9-1bf9-45da-8a67-d3fd630481fd-0
00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:14.501
Take another look to see if
there's any remaining soap

6372ece9-1bf9-45da-8a67-d3fd630481fd-1
00:06:14.501 --> 00:06:14.840
scents.

a826b97a-82c8-428a-8502-1de949d72b68-0
00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:26.121
Take one more pass and then we
will take a sterile, lint free

a826b97a-82c8-428a-8502-1de949d72b68-1
00:06:26.121 --> 00:06:36.730
wiper and we want to pat the
hand all the way to the elbow.

8ecc8ca4-68f1-486a-bb40-4b7b8dd5e863-0
00:06:36.730 --> 00:06:38.170
We're going to pat dry.

4eeb3fc2-ca13-4d0d-83fe-fe7d3a8a4c5f-0
00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:47.985
We'll get another sterile, lint
free towel and we'll pat the

4eeb3fc2-ca13-4d0d-83fe-fe7d3a8a4c5f-1
00:06:47.985 --> 00:06:51.480
hand all the way to the elbow.

69efd293-6d36-4b8e-874a-5aa4c1f09348-0
00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:06.310
We have just completed the
aseptic hand washing.

9296f7db-e074-420a-83d4-63cc74f98bf6-0
00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:09.470
The compounder will Don the
sterile gown.

4d72b7f4-9390-41bf-8bdf-4a8a096756d4-0
00:07:10.310 --> 00:07:15.855
Take the gown out of the outer
packaging and place it on the

4d72b7f4-9390-41bf-8bdf-4a8a096756d4-1
00:07:15.855 --> 00:07:21.672
work surface and when you unwrap
the gown, you want to turn the

4d72b7f4-9390-41bf-8bdf-4a8a096756d4-2
00:07:21.672 --> 00:07:25.400
gown and hold the gown by the
shoulders.

73f522b6-d1b6-443f-a5b4-54f759b9b17e-0
00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:33.294
Make sure that the gown doesn't
touch the floor and as you hold

73f522b6-d1b6-443f-a5b4-54f759b9b17e-1
00:07:33.294 --> 00:07:40.075
the shoulder you can put each
sleeve on and then you can

73f522b6-d1b6-443f-a5b4-54f759b9b17e-2
00:07:40.075 --> 00:07:47.808
position the Velcro across your
neck and with the other hand you

73f522b6-d1b6-443f-a5b4-54f759b9b17e-3
00:07:47.808 --> 00:07:53.400
can reach that section of the
Velcro insecure.

5e6f792a-3f2f-40c2-a326-cf15d35957ec-0
00:08:00.350 --> 00:08:03.790
And you want to tuck that left
side of the gown.

58ae1359-fc50-4cbe-be87-3b4ac4beccbc-0
00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:13.048
You want to tuck that in first
and then you want to bring the

58ae1359-fc50-4cbe-be87-3b4ac4beccbc-1
00:08:13.048 --> 00:08:18.064
right side of the gown around
your body and that tie you can

58ae1359-fc50-4cbe-be87-3b4ac4beccbc-2
00:08:18.064 --> 00:08:21.600
hand to yourself and make a nice
bow here.

3ff05631-1781-4c3f-b04f-e7a14ccce4cc-0
00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:25.336
And you want to be tucked into
your gown so that it doesn't

3ff05631-1781-4c3f-b04f-e7a14ccce4cc-1
00:08:25.336 --> 00:08:27.640
come apart when you get to the
hood.

f47379e0-09b1-4f17-940f-0426c746d827-0
00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:33.289
Now we can hand sanitize our
hands and we're ready to go into

f47379e0-09b1-4f17-940f-0426c746d827-1
00:08:33.289 --> 00:08:34.520
the buffer room.

eade197c-7624-4407-b68f-a00340ef3673-0
00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:39.329
We will finish the hand hygiene
and garbing procedure by donning

eade197c-7624-4407-b68f-a00340ef3673-1
00:08:39.329 --> 00:08:41.280
our powder free sterile gloves.

ee525a30-f89a-4385-8b55-e9578d3e728b-0
00:08:41.720 --> 00:08:44.916
Open the outer wrapper of our
sterile gloves and discard the

ee525a30-f89a-4385-8b55-e9578d3e728b-1
00:08:44.916 --> 00:08:45.440
packaging.

d5955395-60f0-4890-a8a5-01f4f78f2e3d-0
00:08:46.280 --> 00:08:47.560
Open the inner gloves.

f70fb247-3bba-405d-99c4-066b4a57cf32-0
00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:50.320
Ensure that you don't touch the
gloves with your bare hands.

1f8e2a4c-5f77-4bf5-aafe-86594171a168-0
00:08:51.120 --> 00:08:56.174
Per USP 797 will apply an
alcohol based hand rub to all

1f8e2a4c-5f77-4bf5-aafe-86594171a168-1
00:08:56.174 --> 00:08:58.160
surfaces of the hands.

76fb3b26-e69e-4cc8-83ba-cceaa532ef28-0
00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:02.320
You'll pull the sleeve of your
gown holding onto the cuff.

67a5f4ce-ea22-4ead-8c26-f8d27d8efd01-0
00:09:02.320 --> 00:09:06.592
With your thumb and forefinger
you'll grasp the fold of the

67a5f4ce-ea22-4ead-8c26-f8d27d8efd01-1
00:09:06.592 --> 00:09:08.800
cuff and pull it over the hand.

03a1087b-46ca-4b31-96de-c762b5e6f000-0
00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:12.320
Don't adjust the cuff quite yet.

d9f874b4-f124-48e3-b39f-576dd82b4626-0
00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:21.642
And then we will pull the sleeve
of our opposite hand, and by the

d9f874b4-f124-48e3-b39f-576dd82b4626-1
00:09:21.642 --> 00:09:25.920
cuff we'll pull that glove over
the hand.

b0a4ac23-9948-4c5e-9075-4b2bb4f06bba-0
00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:32.920
And now we can adjust the cuffs.

775328b5-965d-4bbf-ba1b-982b69e70e4b-0
00:09:38.520 --> 00:09:43.080
We can discard that inner
packaging and per USP 797, you

775328b5-965d-4bbf-ba1b-982b69e70e4b-1
00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:47.640
must sanitize your hands with
sterile isopropyl alcohol.